(28, 'Meckel diverticulum', 'Why does a Meckel diverticulum bleed?', 'Ectopic gastric mucosa makes acid that ulcerates the ileum.', 2),
(29, 'Meckel diverticulum', 'What is the test of choice for Meckel diverticulum?', 'A technetium-99m pertechnetate scan.', 2),
(30, 'Meckel diverticulum', 'How is a bleeding Meckel diverticulum treated?', 'By surgical resection.', 1),
